urname><given-names>LI</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>HS</given-names></name><name><surname>Chiang</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>WH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Epstein-Barr virus-associated gastric adenocarcinomas in Taiwan</article-title><source>Hum Pathol</source><year>1995</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>267</fpage><lpage>271</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Hum Pathol||26|267||bib5|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7890276</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Herrera-Goepfert</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Reyes</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Hernandez-Avila</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mohar</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Shinkura</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Fujiyama</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Aiba</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Eizuru</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Harada</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Tokunaga</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Epstein-Barr virus-associated gastric carcinoma in Mexico: analysis of 135 consecutive gastrectomies in two hospitals</article-title><source>Mod Pathol</source><year>1999</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>873</fpage><lpage>878</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Mod Pathol||12|873||bib6|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10496595</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Imai</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Koizumi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sugiura</surname><given-names>M</given-names></nam